usage: python -m sgg_core.experiments.experiment_2 [-h]
                                                   --dataset {vg,oi,gqa,psg,vrd}
                                                   --data_root DATA_ROOT
                                                   [--train_ann TRAIN_ANN]
                                                   [--eval_ann EVAL_ANN]
                                                   [--image_root IMAGE_ROOT]
                                                   [--panoptic_root PANOPTIC_ROOT]
                                                   [--official_manifest OFFICIAL_MANIFEST]
                                                   --output_dir OUTPUT_DIR
                                                   [--analysis_scope {observational,interventional,both}]
                                                   [--train_samples TRAIN_SAMPLES]
                                                   [--eval_samples EVAL_SAMPLES]
                                                   [--pair_hit_ks PAIR_HIT_KS [PAIR_HIT_KS ...]]
                                                   [--primary_k PRIMARY_K]
                                                   [--perturbation_levels PERTURBATION_LEVELS [PERTURBATION_LEVELS ...]]
                                                   [--perturbation_strategies PERTURBATION_STRATEGIES [PERTURBATION_STRATEGIES ...]]
                                                   [--perturbation_seeds PERTURBATION_SEEDS [PERTURBATION_SEEDS ...]]
                                                   [--minimum_relations MINIMUM_RELATIONS]
                                                   [--minimum_clean_recall MINIMUM_CLEAN_RECALL]
                                                   [--minimum_pvr_checked MINIMUM_PVR_CHECKED]
                                                   [--skip_pair_audit]
                                                   [--skip_physical_consistency]
                                                   [--seed SEED]
                                                   [--device DEVICE]

Experiment II: real-checkpoint pair grounding and prior-dependence audit. This
paper entry point refuses surrogate or randomly initialized models. The former
GT-injected simulator is intentionally absent from this core package.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --dataset {vg,oi,gqa,psg,vrd}
  --data_root DATA_ROOT
  --train_ann TRAIN_ANN
  --eval_ann EVAL_ANN
  --image_root IMAGE_ROOT
  --panoptic_root PANOPTIC_ROOT
  --official_manifest OFFICIAL_MANIFEST
  --output_dir OUTPUT_DIR
  --analysis_scope {observational,interventional,both}
                        observational reuses SGCls/SGDet predictions for
                        endpoint-error stratification; interventional requires
                        a GT-pair live adapter
  --train_samples TRAIN_SAMPLES
  --eval_samples EVAL_SAMPLES
  --pair_hit_ks PAIR_HIT_KS [PAIR_HIT_KS ...]
                        Predicate Hit@K on GT pairs; this is not image-level
                        SGG Recall@K.
  --primary_k PRIMARY_K
  --perturbation_levels PERTURBATION_LEVELS [PERTURBATION_LEVELS ...]
  --perturbation_strategies PERTURBATION_STRATEGIES [PERTURBATION_STRATEGIES ...]
  --perturbation_seeds PERTURBATION_SEEDS [PERTURBATION_SEEDS ...]
  --minimum_relations MINIMUM_RELATIONS
  --minimum_clean_recall MINIMUM_CLEAN_RECALL
  --minimum_pvr_checked MINIMUM_PVR_CHECKED
  --skip_pair_audit     Skip the duplicate terminal BRR audit when the dose
                        sweep is primary.
  --skip_physical_consistency
                        Skip PVR in the converged object-error propagation
                        experiment.
  --seed SEED
  --device DEVICE
